{"synopsis":"Oleh Studio yang membawakan Childhood Friend of the Zenith.\n\nPhantom Swordsman Dokgo Heon, Master hebat dari faksi Unortodoks,\nbersama dengan Hyun Jo, Master dari Sekte Mount Hua, menjalin persabatan melalui pedang.\n\nAkan tetapi, Kultus Demonic yang melancarkan serangan tiba-tiba, secara tragis mengakhiri hidup Hyun Jo.\nSaat di ambang kematiannya, Dokgo Heon merasuki tubuh Mu Hwi, murid dari Hyun Jo.\n\n...Dan dengan begitulah dimulainya perjuangan Mu Hwi memenuhi keinginan temannya yang sedang sekarang - untuk menyelamatkan sekte.","alternative_title":"화산파 천재검귀","author":"Muhyang, Wang Jae-Deok","artist":"Kim Si-Woon","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"addb262d-eea7-46c6-a0ba-7e63ffc53a7e","number":"74","chapter":"74","title":"","date":"2026-07-28","released":"2026-07-28","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_5d56add0-399a-47f6-ba93-12af1d53accf/chapter_ch_74/1.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_5d56add0-399a-47f6-ba93-12af1d53accf/chapter_ch_74/2.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_5d56add0-399a-47f6-ba93-12af1d53accf/chapter_ch_74/3.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_5d56add0-399a-47f6-ba93-12af1d53accf/chapter_ch_74/4.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_5d56add0-399a-47f6-ba93-12af1d53accf/chapter_ch_74/5.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_5d56add0-399a-47f6-ba93-12af1d53accf/chapter_ch_74/6.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_5d56add0-399a-47f6-ba93-12af1d53accf/chapter_ch_74/7.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_5d56add0-399a-47f6-ba93-12af1d53accf/chapter_ch_74/8.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_5d56add0-399a-47f6-ba93-12af1d53accf/chapter_ch_74/9.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_5d56add0-399a-47f6-ba93-12af1d53accf/chapter_ch_74/10.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_5d56add0-399a-47f6-ba93-12af1d53accf/chapter_ch_74/11.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_5d56add0-399a-47f6-ba93-12af1d53accf/chapter_ch_74/12.webp"]},{"chapter_id":